# Optional settings. Copy this file to ".env" only if you need to change one.
# ".env" is git-ignored. This example is public, so it holds no real values.

# Where Home Base keeps its data. By default this is the system's app-data
# folder (see docs/PERSISTENCE.md). It must not be inside this repository.
# HOMEBASE_DATA_DIR=

# The port the core listens on.
# HOMEBASE_PORT=7117

# Web search, for HELIOS's web access (docs/WEB-ACCESS.md). One of the two is
# enough; with both, Brave Search is used. A key is sent to its own service
# only, and is never written to the settings, the database or a log.
# BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY=
# TAVILY_API_KEY=

# Claude, the optional cloud model (docs/CLAUDE-API.md). An API key from the
# Anthropic Console. API use is billed per request, on its own: a Claude
# subscription does not include it. The key alone switches nothing on:
# cloud models stay off until they are turned on from the screen, and even
# then Claude answers only a message in which you ask for it.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
